Package: com.galaxybudsclient.noisecc
Name: Galaxy Buds Noise Control (Control Center)
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Control Center module for Galaxy Buds noise control (GalaxyBudsClient iOS port). Tap to switch between noise cancelling and ambient sound, long press for Off and Adaptive. Works whether or not the app is open.
Maintainer: GalaxyBudsClient-iOS
Author: GalaxyBudsClient-iOS
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), com.opa334.ccsupport (>= 1.3), com.galaxybudsclient.budsrfcomm (>= 0.4.0)
